1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,609
Research starts with a question. But a confident answer is only useful when you can follow

2
00:00:06,609 --> 00:00:07,563
its evidence.

3
00:00:07,563 --> 00:00:13,357
PaperClaw Research Companion helps an environmental researcher build a reading trail for a

4
00:00:13,357 --> 00:00:14,966
water treatment briefing.

5
00:00:14,966 --> 00:00:22,339
Here, we ask about microplastics removal from drinking water. This is the running product,

6
00:00:22,339 --> 00:00:26,189
searching real publications through Europe PMC.

7
00:00:26,189 --> 00:00:33,136
Each source shows its title, authors, date and publication type. Short abstract excerpts

8
00:00:33,136 --> 00:00:39,846
are labeled as author statements. The references open the actual publication records.

9
00:00:39,846 --> 00:00:47,232
Now we compare two sources. A focused filtration preprint and a broad scoping review offer

10
00:00:47,232 --> 00:00:54,126
different lenses. Shared words indicate topic overlap, not scientific consensus. The

11
00:00:54,126 --> 00:00:57,163
assistant keeps the unknowns visible.

12
00:00:57,163 --> 00:01:03,379
We select the useful sources, name a private collection and save it. Returning to the

13
00:01:03,379 --> 00:01:09,887
collection preserves the evidence trail. Export produces a portable brief with references

14
00:01:09,887 --> 00:01:11,350
and retrieval dates.

15
00:01:11,350 --> 00:01:17,367
This is a new conversational research workflow built for the hackathon, extending the

16
00:01:17,367 --> 00:01:20,552
PaperClaw ecosystem beyond publishing papers.

17
00:01:20,552 --> 00:01:28,312
Behind the interface, real MCP tools use protocol version twenty twenty five, eleven,

18
00:01:28,312 --> 00:01:36,528
twenty five, over Streamable HTTP. An official client verified the tools. Collections stay

19
00:01:36,528 --> 00:01:38,719
in local SQLite storage.

20
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:45,974
This is our independent Alexa plus simulator, without a certified Echo connection. Text

21
00:01:45,974 --> 00:01:52,312
